Production RAG Assistant environment template

Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values.

NEVER commit a populated .env or real credentials.

In AWS, production runtime secrets are injected from Secrets Manager.

PostgreSQL

Local libpq-style example only:

DATABASE_URL=dbname=production_rag user=postgres password=YOUR_PASSWORD host=localhost port=5432

DATABASE_URL=

OpenAI

OPENAI_API_KEY=

Langfuse

LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY= LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=
LANGFUSE_BASE_URL=https://cloud.langfuse.com

Use development locally; ECS can set production at runtime.

LANGFUSE_TRACING_ENVIRONMENT=development
